# config.toml (copied from config.example.toml) is the first choice for
# configuring this project -- see README.md's "Configuration" section. The
# real OS environment variables below are an override/escape hatch on top of
# it: useful for CI (a self-hosted runner's working directory gets
# `git clean`ed between runs, so a git-ignored config.toml there wouldn't
# persist) or for a one-off change without editing config.toml. None of these
# are read from a .env file -- credentials.py/config.py load config.toml and
# real OS env vars only, never dotenv.

# Secrets folder override (alternative to config.toml's [secrets] override;
# checked first when set). os.pathsep-separated for more than one candidate.
# FORECASTER_SECRETS_DIR=C:\path\to\Secrets

# PostgreSQL — non-secret overrides (defaults shown; host/user/password are
# secrets and always come from the Secrets folder, never from here)
# DB_PORT=5432
# DB_NAME=investment_forecaster
# PORTFOLIO_DB_NAME=investment_portfolio

# IBKR Client Portal Gateway (primary market data source)
# Leave as default if running on the same machine as TWS / Client Portal Gateway.
# IBKR_GATEWAY_URL=https://localhost:5000
